# Local real-PDF calibration corpus (D11-04) — licensing/size keep real PDFs
# local; only DERIVED evidence commits (tests/unit/server/pdf-calibration/).
# The README is the directory's committed convention card.
corpus/pdf/*
!corpus/pdf/README.md

# Local real-EPUB calibration corpus (D12-12, the D11-04 mirror) —
# licensing/size keep real books local; only DERIVED evidence commits
# (tests/unit/server/epub-calibration/). README is the convention card.
corpus/epub/*
!corpus/epub/README.md
